//! # hanihi-cli
//!
//! REPL front-end for the agent harness: reedline line editor on top of
//! [`hanihi_core::Agent`]. Supports sessions (`--session` / `--new-session`),
//! one-shot turns (`--once`), and MCP stdio servers.

